PMBI-Net local research distribution

This project retains code from TQNet:
https://github.com/ACAT-SCUT/TQNet
Temporal Query Network for Efficient Multivariate Time Series Forecasting,
Shengsheng Lin, Haojun Chen, Haijie Wu, Chunyun Qiu, Weiwei Lin, ICML 2025.
The original local Apache License 2.0 is preserved verbatim in LICENSE.

Local modifications: PMBI-Net V2 temporal pyramid (pre-existing research code),
portable configuration/entry/registry adaptation, independent migration checks and documentation.
Original model files were copied without algorithm changes during migration.
Original TQNet acknowledges CycleNet, SparseTSF, iTransformer, SegRNN, PatchTST,
LTSF-Linear, Informer, Autoformer, FEDformer, Pyraformer, RevIN and tsai.
No assertion is made that datasets or trained weights share the source-code license.
Publication authorization and the ownership/license of local PMBI-Net additions
must be confirmed by the authors before any public release. No repository was published.

PMBI-Net naming refactor: full V2 implementation copied into models/PMBI_Net.py,
helper functions moved unchanged to utils/pmbi_helpers.py; registry/configuration,
explicit legacy evaluation and documentation updated. No model algorithm changed.
